   the accelerating/braking bar and its reading. In the Vintage styles the window is an orange LCD. */
.speed { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; justify-content: center; gap: 4cqh; padding: 6cqmin; font-family: var(--d-font); }
.speed .sp-k { position: absolute; left: 6cqmin; top: 5cqmin; color: var(--d-label); font-size: var(--t-lbl); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
