   and the alarm banner's look. The boxes, numbers and charts draw only with these variables, so a new
   theme is one block here plus a line in the dash's THEMES (dashes/tunerloop-dash/box_list.js). The app
   loads this file too (the action buttons' banner, js/feedback.js); a dash's frame gets it without the
   @font-face rules (the fonts go to a frame as bytes: js/dash/loader.js). */
